# devenv-ai-assistant agent rules

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Summary:

- Flat editor-AI repo: `nvim-init.lua`, `vimrc`, `install.sh`, docs; RPM via
  `devenv-ai-assistant.spec` + `rpm/` loaders (no overwrite of user init).
- CLI in devenv-ai-helper; LSP/TS in devenv-lsp-setup; images in devenv-packager.
- Keep keymap → CLI subcommands and `DEVENV_AI_*` / `VIM_AI_*` fallback stable.
- Never commit secrets or chat dumps.
- Verify with `bash -n install.sh` and editor/RPM checks when packaging changes.
